  tutorials:
  - section: 0
    formula: Subject|am / is / are|Verb + ing|Object / Keterangan
    explanation: 'Subject diikuti <b>am / is / are</b>: I + am, He / She / It + is,
      You / We / They + are.

      Kata kerja diberi akhiran <b>-ing</b> (playing,
      cooking).'
    exampleSentence: He-is-playing-games
    exampleRoles: Subject|is|Verb + ing|Object
  - section: 1
    formula: Subject|am / is / are|not|Verb + ing|Object / Keterangan
    explanation: 'Tambahkan <b>not</b> setelah am / is / are.

      Kata kerja tetap
      memakai -ing (is not playing, are not swimming).'
    exampleSentence: They-are-not-swimming
    exampleRoles: Subject|are|not|Verb + ing
  - section: 2
    formula: Am / Is / Are|Subject|Verb + ing|Object / Keterangan + ?
    explanation: 'Kalimat tanya diawali <b>Am / Is / Are</b>, lalu subject dan kata
      kerja -ing.

      Kalimat diakhiri tanda tanya (?).'
    exampleSentence: Is-she-cooking-rice?
    exampleRoles: Is|Subject|Verb + ing|Object + ?
